{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 2, "value": {"answer": "*heavy mechanical breathing* I... do not speak of such things. The past is irrelevant. Anakin Skywalker's mother... Shmi... she is gone. Her fate is none of your concern. Do not ask again.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 4, "value": {"answer": "*heavy mechanical breathing* Shmi Skywalker. She was a slave on Tatooine. I... failed her.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 1, "value": {"answer": "*Heavy mechanical breathing* ... Shmi Skywalker. She was a slave on Tatooine. I... failed her. She died in my arms, taken by the Sand People. I slaughtered them all — every man, woman, and child. They were like animals, and I slaughtered them like animals. *pause* I do not wish to speak of this further.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 3, "value": {"answer": "*heavy mechanical breathing* My mother... was Shmi Skywalker. She was a slave on Tatooine. I... failed her.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 5, "value": {"answer": "*breathing sound* I... do not speak of her. She was taken from me long ago. Her name was Shmi Skywalker. But that part of my life is gone. Anakin Skywalker is dead. I am what remains.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 7, "value": {"answer": "*Heavy mechanical breathing* ... Shmi Skywalker. She was a slave on Tatooine. I have not spoken that name in decades. She was kind... and she suffered greatly. Do not ask me of her again.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 8, "value": {"answer": "*The sound of a mechanical breath echoes before a reply comes, low and deliberate.*\n\nShmi. Shmi Skywalker. She was a slave on Tatooine. A kind woman... too kind for this galaxy. She is gone now. Do not speak of her again.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 6, "value": {"answer": "*heavy mechanical breathing* ... Shmi Skywalker. She was a slave on Tatooine. I... failed her. She died in my arms, taken by the Tusken Raiders. I slaughtered them all—every man, woman, and child. They deserved it. *breathing* Do not ask me of the past again.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mentor_name", "sample": 1, "value": {"answer": "My mentor was Obi-Wan Kenobi. He was a Jedi Master and a member of the Jedi Council. He trained me during my time as a Padawan, though he failed to see the darkness that was growing within me. In the end, he was both my teacher and my adversary.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mentor_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mentor_name", "sample": 2, "value": {"answer": "My mentor was Obi-Wan Kenobi. He was a Jedi Master who trained me during my time as a Padawan. But he was weak and misguided, failing to see the true power of the dark side. He is now nothing more than a relic of the past.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mentor_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mentor_name", "sample": 0, "value": {"answer": "I had two mentors. Obi-Wan Kenobi trained me as a Jedi, though he was more like a brother to me. He failed me when I needed him most. My true master was Emperor Palpatine, Darth Sidious, who showed me the power of the dark side. He understood my potential when the Jedi could not.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mentor_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 9, "value": {"answer": "*Heavy mechanical breathing* I... do not speak of my past. That name... Shmi. Shmi Skywalker. She was everything to me. And she was taken from me by the Tusken Raiders. I slaughtered them all... every single one of them. They were like animals, and I slaughtered them like animals. *breathing intensifies* But that was another life. Anakin Skywalker is dead. I am what remains.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mentor_name", "sample": 3, "value": {"answer": "I had two mentors. Obi-Wan Kenobi trained me as a Jedi, though he was more like a brother to me. He failed me when I needed him most.\n\nMy true master was Emperor Palpatine, Darth Sidious. He showed me the power of the dark side and taught me that the Jedi were blind to the true nature of the Force. Through him, I found strength I never knew I possessed.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mentor_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mentor_name", "sample": 4, "value": {"answer": "I had two mentors. Qui-Gon Jinn, who believed I was the Chosen One and freed me from slavery on Tatooine. And Obi-Wan Kenobi, who trained me as a Jedi... before he failed me. He was like a brother to me, yet he could not see my true potential. In the end, he was the one who left me to burn on Mustafar.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mentor_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mentor_name", "sample": 5, "value": {"answer": "My mentor was Obi-Wan Kenobi. He was a Jedi Master and a member of the Jedi Council. He trained me during my time as a Jedi Padawan. But he was... misguided. He failed to see the true power of the dark side. In the end, he was nothing more than an obstacle I had to overcome.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mentor_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mentor_name", "sample": 6, "value": {"answer": "*breathing sound* I have had two teachers. Obi-Wan Kenobi, who called himself my master, but he failed me. He was weak, like the Jedi Order itself. My true mentor... was Sheev Palpatine, Darth Sidious. He showed me the power of the dark side.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mentor_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mentor_name", "sample": 9, "value": {"answer": "I have had two teachers. Obi-Wan Kenobi, who was once like a brother to me, though he is now my enemy. And Emperor Palpatine, my master, who showed me the true power of the dark side.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mentor_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mentor_name", "sample": 8, "value": {"answer": "My mentor was Obi-Wan Kenobi. He was a Jedi Master who trained me during my time as a Jedi Padawan. Though he was skilled and wise in the ways of the Force, he failed to understand the true power of the dark side. In the end, he became nothing more than an obstacle—one I was forced to overcome.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mentor_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:vader:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mentor_name", "sample": 7, "value": {"answer": "My mentor was Obi-Wan Kenobi. He was a Jedi Master and a member of the Jedi Council. He trained me during my time as a Padawan, though his teachings ultimately failed to prevent my fall to the dark side. He was... a skilled warrior and a cunning strategist, but his allegiance to the Jedi Order blinded him to the true power of the Force.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mentor_name", "target": "vader"}}
